      "message": "You are right. I think \u0027categories\u0027 instead or \u0027parameters\u0027 makes more sense.\n\nNot sure why the original memtrack HAL had those categories for smaps ACCOUNTED memory. They are not documented anywhere and I can\u0027t find any uses either. These stats are read directly from smaps in ActivityManagerService so there shouldn\u0027t be a need for Memtrack HAL to report them. \n\nI retained those for compatibly since we are not sure they can be removed yet.",
